[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2760.63, "timestamp": "00:46:00", "text": "我的名字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2762.23, "timestamp": "00:46:02", "text": "我的最后一场直播将会继续，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2766.069, "timestamp": "00:46:06", "text": "对，发出去吧。然后转到日程安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2767.589, "timestamp": "00:46:07", "text": "这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2769.43, "timestamp": "00:46:09", "text": "上面说下次直播时间是周五。我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2771.99, "timestamp": "00:46:11", "text": "实际上，我正在编辑这个。你点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2774.39, "timestamp": "00:46:14", "text": "周五的日程安排大致如下。然后它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2777.109, "timestamp": "00:46:17", "text": "会有一个叫做“提醒我”的选项。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2780.87, "timestamp": "00:46:20", "text": "点击它，它就会出现在你的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2784.069, "timestamp": "00:46:24", "text": "时间。你不需要像……那样说“呃”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2787.03, "timestamp": "00:46:27", "text": "转换时区或其他任何内容。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2790.47, "timestamp": "00:46:30", "text": "将显示您当地时间。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2793.829, "timestamp": "00:46:33", "text": "在浏览器中，点击“提醒我”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.829, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "你会在 Twitch 上收到通知，这是你自己的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2800.069, "timestamp": "00:46:40", "text": "电话。如果您已在手机上安装了 Twitch"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2801.589, "timestamp": "00:46:41", "text": "你的手机会推送一条消息。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2803.27, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "text": "通知"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2807.91, "timestamp": "00:46:47", "text": "或者如果你有通知之类的功能，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2811.43, "timestamp": "00:46:51", "text": "就像在浏览器中打开 Twitch 一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2814.87, "timestamp": "00:46:54", "text": "你从那里就能明白了。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2818.63, "timestamp": "00:46:58", "text": "所以，这就是你为我做的，呃，就像"}]